        },
        {
          "text": "Biatuta muntu muhika wandi mulume anyi muhika wandi mukashi ku disu, ne biafuadi, yeye neamumushe ku butaka buandi bualu bua disu diandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.26",
